designer_notes = "THE FIRST CREATURE (hunting, 2026-11-09, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 3): Quaternius's CC0 deer (Ultimate Animated Animals, game/regents/art/animals/Deer.gltf, 4.4 m long as made, scaled 0.38 here to about 1.7 m), animated by its own clips (game/regents/anim/deer_animation.tres, written by build_animal_sets.gd: it grazes standing, walks, gallops). Its brain (regents/deer, the sidecar's) grazes round home and flees; what it is in play is its FoeDef's (content/foe/deer.tres)."
